raylib
------
  Copyright (c) 2013-2026 Ramon Santamaria (@raysan5)
  https://github.com/raysan5/raylib
  Licensed under the zlib/libpng license.

  This project does not vendor or redistribute raylib itself: it loads the
  system-installed libraylib shared library at runtime over its C ABI, and
  links lib/libraygui.dylib against that same library.

  src/net/b12n/raygui_jlt/raylib.clj is a trimmed derivative of the raylib
  bindings in the sibling project b12n-raylib-jlt, carrying only the window,
  frame, input, colour and text surface these examples need.
